<title>JAPAN: Osaka bourse to suspend trading of Hanwa Bank.</title>
<headline>Osaka bourse to suspend trading of Hanwa Bank.</headline>
<dateline>OSAKA, Japan 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) will suspended trading of shares in Hanwa Bank Ltd for the whole of Thursday, an official at the exchange told Reuters.</p>
<p>The exchange will make an official announcement on the suspension soon, the official said.</p>
</text>
